<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico injects 144 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico injects 144 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico injected 144 million pesos into the secondary market on Thursday through a single credit auction, dealers said.</p>
<p>The auction was placed as as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT     TERM     AVERAGE RATE</p>
<p>    144 million    1 day    16.97 pct</p>
<p>*Amounts in pesos</p>
<p>((--Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9559))</p>
</text>
